            {
                "entry_id": "d13ac5ba-dcbb-3945-8511-a179eb8e31b0",
                "word": "conspirateur",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "328c5903-e6b9-4442-a615-83a2163e60b5",
                        "entry_id": "d13ac5ba-dcbb-3945-8511-a179eb8e31b0",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "conspirateurs"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "0b3e328d-1292-4ef5-9513-7a14760ef4ac",
                        "entry_id": "d13ac5ba-dcbb-3945-8511-a179eb8e31b0",
                        "tags": [
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "conspiratrice"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ba6581d3-9da5-3803-a532-cd2bb61cbe7a",
                        "entry_id": "d13ac5ba-dcbb-3945-8511-a179eb8e31b0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Celui qui conspire."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "403c44e1-ccb6-49bf-a7fd-1b2b3baa313a",
                                "sense_id": "ba6581d3-9da5-3803-a532-cd2bb61cbe7a",
                                "text": "Une prompte enquête, instruite par le coroner Mac-Ma-Hong, révéla que le conspirateur n’était pas le meurtrier ; la machine à désélectrocuter n’étant pas encore inventée, on inhuma le malheureux innocent."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "067d1e9c-90a1-4a5c-8d7f-f9fabddebf0d",
                                "sense_id": "ba6581d3-9da5-3803-a532-cd2bb61cbe7a",
                                "text": "Cette sauvage sortie fut réprimée par Cérizet, qui dit à la revendeuse un de ces chut ! prolongés auxquels obéissent tous les conspirateurs."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "806b43bc-c4e6-4b43-9fc7-ca8e244db3f0",
                                "sense_id": "ba6581d3-9da5-3803-a532-cd2bb61cbe7a",
                                "text": "Les sections de la fière cité de Marseille ont bien mérité de la patrie, législateurs; elles ont désagonisé l’esprit public, septembrisé par une faction liberticide; et s’armant de la pique redoutable, elles ont terrassé les insolens conspirateurs qui étaient dans leur sein."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3ee05323-8508-4fc6-8e83-a24b49026643",
                        "source_entry_id": "d13ac5ba-dcbb-3945-8511-a179eb8e31b0",
                        "source_sense_id": "ba6581d3-9da5-3803-a532-cd2bb61cbe7a",
                        "target_lang_word": "conspirator",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "conspirator",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dc8007bf-bce5-3094-9f18-bdfd70a883b6",
                                        "entry_id": "cc762a07-ffae-328f-96a2-23661315d63f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One of a group that acts in harmony to do something unlawful and unethical; a person who is part of a conspiracy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9f1287b6-fb9a-45f9-a484-2135f1475c8d",
                                                "sense_id": "dc8007bf-bce5-3094-9f18-bdfd70a883b6",
                                                "text": "The conspirators were rounded up by the police and arrested."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cc5524f4-d998-47f2-8a1e-65992728c80d",
                                                "sense_id": "dc8007bf-bce5-3094-9f18-bdfd70a883b6",
                                                "text": "All the Jacobite gentry of that part of the country were collected together; though, it must be confessed, their appearance and their usual after-dinner conversation were rather at variance. Now they looked calm and comfortable, with as little the appearance of conspirators as possible; then they were (by their own account) the most oppressed of individuals, and the most devoted of partisans, ready to die, so that their wrongs were redressed, and the rightful king restored."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "df1754c2-a363-4f91-976a-a77f696561f7",
                        "source_entry_id": "d13ac5ba-dcbb-3945-8511-a179eb8e31b0",
                        "source_sense_id": "ba6581d3-9da5-3803-a532-cd2bb61cbe7a",
                        "target_lang_word": "συνωμότης",
                        "target_lang_code": "el",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "συνωμότης",
                                "target_lang_code": "el",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d1f0ce74-3c2d-3d2c-9979-b382e3cf69d8",
                                        "entry_id": "b156b439-98e1-3b40-b045-6f4adddf41d4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "αυτός που συμμετέχει σε μια συνωμοσία, που σχεδιάζει κάτι μυστικά μαζί με άλλους"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2091a03d-593d-4b2f-b853-a5446d77d037",
                                                "sense_id": "d1f0ce74-3c2d-3d2c-9979-b382e3cf69d8",
                                                "text": "※ Συμμετέχω σε μια συνωμοσία σιωπής, και μπορεί το Bacardi να έλυσε λίγο τη γλώσσα μου, αλλά παραμένω καλός συνωμότης . (Δημοσθένης Κούρτοβικ, Φυσαλία η καλλιαύχην [διήγημα])"
